            <ArticleTitle>[Expert evaluation and rehabilitation of nonspecific pain conditions].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>127-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Daily expertising practice shows that in case of exclusively somatically induced unspecific pain chronification is greatly enhanced. Faced with such phenomena, it is suggested that a dualistic manner of interpretation and treatment taking into consideration in equal measure both somatic and psychosocial factors and their mutual interaction, may initiate a change in the general trend of the patient's complaints towards eventual relief.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
